sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User (iPad)
  participant UI as UI thread
  participant W as Worker (agent loop)
  participant FS as Browser vault fs
  participant L as LLM API
  U->>UI: prompt "add Seen: yes to the Dune note"
  UI->>W: runTurn(prompt, chatId)
  W->>FS: load chat history + skills catalog
  loop until the model stops calling tools
    W->>L: streamText(messages, tools)
    L-->>W: tool call search("Dune")
    W->>FS: scan / index query
    W-->>UI: chip "search Dune"
    W->>L: tool result
    L-->>W: tool call write_file(path, text)
    W->>FS: write (version check vs. editor)
    W-->>UI: chip "changed Wiki/dune.md"
  end
  L-->>W: final text (streamed)
  W->>FS: checkpoint chat (resume if iOS kills the tab)
  W-->>UI: answer · changes badge +1
  Note over U,W: Commit & Push later = git commit in the browser + push (proxy) or one API commit
